          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Through your wiles, charm, or a little bit of magic, you lure in a foe for a closer look—and a quick bite! Choose a creature within 30 feet. It must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell|options:forced-movement] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.</p>\n<p>If the target fails its save, you pull it up to 30 feet. If the target ends this movement in reach of your jaws, you can attempt a jaws Strike against it. Regardless of the result of its save, the target is temporarily immune for 24 hours.</p>"
          },
